# Span — compatibility re-export
#
# The canonical `Span` now lives in the language-neutral stdlib module
# `std.common.diagnostics.span` (src/lib/common/diagnostics/span.spl) so that
# non-compiler producers (CMM, Markdown, lint providers) can share it without
# depending on the compiler tree. `compiler.common.diagnostics.span.Span` is
# the SAME type (re-export, not a copy) — see
# test/01_unit/compiler_shared/diagnostics/diagnostic_v1_spec.spl
# "names the same type through both import paths".

use std.common.diagnostics.span.{Span}

export Span
